{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/946920-climbing-the-ladder-with-a-big-group","id":946920,"title":"Climbing the Ladder with a Big Group","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-09T07:13:20-07:00","id":946920,"title":"Climbing the Ladder with a Big Group","content":"I've got 7 regular players and 3 that are frequently traveling and thus only in our group occasionally. I'm not sure how well Climbing the Ladder would work with 10 players--especially considering that is going to be ~100 NPCs and some very interconnected Kindred. Has anyone attempted that with such a large group?<br /> <br /> Any advice on things I should tweak to make Session 0 not bog down?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6326-krelios","name":"krelios","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6326_1.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T07:24:29-07:00","id":946923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>krelios</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/946920-climbing-the-ladder-with-a-big-group#post946920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone attempted that with such a large group?<br /> <br /> Any advice on things I should tweak to make Session 0 not bog down?</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't, but one thing you might do is encourage the players to use other player characters or NPCs the players have 'created' in their own ladder. It would at least cut down on the number of NPCs and in some ways help flesh out characters, for instance if multiple people decides Rime is the one who tricked them right out of the Embrace, it seems like they've become the sort to prey on neonates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}